{"title":"2015 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/f/72f534bec5d0cb7fe3d8a3b8e32e19857c0a794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{\\log_2a} + \\frac{1}{\\log_3a} + \\frac{1}{\\log_4a} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"222\" height=\"43\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/2/c223e393487540a4e13959b02dd46bc83a82afef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 9\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 12\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 18\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 24\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"385\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We use the change of base formula to show that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/3/f73e271cefc08bdc7f68146a8b825b7186a45f32.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_a b = \\dfrac{\\log_b b}{\\log_b a} = \\dfrac{1}{\\log_b a}.\\]\" width=\"187\" height=\"42\" />\nThus, our equation becomes\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/2/10290ea33d9b8f7e8c2fce22f914ab6872c10f8a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_a 2 + \\log_a 3 + \\log_a 4 = 1,\\]\" width=\"212\" height=\"17\" />\nwhich becomes after combining:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/3/cd3467e85a1cde569caa3051ba6a69ec140d9b84.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_a 24 = 1.\\]\" width=\"89\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889b02cf1fc06c35b0822c3e6555b5d52091cfc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/e/4feb78447beef6c93631b0912fb24e7936b6dad3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/RdIIEhsbZKw?t=482\">https://youtu.be/RdIIEhsbZKw?t=482</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Video starts at 1:04, uses the above solution: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OJyWHzjiu2A&amp;t=44s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OJyWHzjiu2A&amp;t=44s</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A\">2015 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsol